WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
In Inspirations, choose Quick Clone on a fashion video.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The reference shows a model wearing white.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Add a portrait of the new model and a photo of a black dress.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Describe how the model and outfit should change.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Choose Recreate. The project opens with the reference and both photos.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.933
The original plays on the left. On the right, the new model wears the black dress.
